// R5 lane PAR-MARGIN item 3: does TradingView check the margin model at each
// intrabar sample under the bar magnifier? One leveraged long (margin 20, 4.608 x equity)
// placed on the signal bar 2025-06-22 12:45 UTC, filled at the next bar's open and
// carried: the bar after the entry bar first crosses the maintenance line at an early
// sub-bar low and reaches a deeper low later in the same 15m bar.
// Magnifier ON. Timeout close 3 bars after the entry bar.
//@version=6
strategy("pm-i3-eth-mag-0622", overlay=true, initial_capital=1000,
     default_qty_type=strategy.fixed, default_qty_value=1, pyramiding=1,
     margin_long=20, margin_short=20, commission_value=0, slippage=0,
     process_orders_on_close=false, use_bar_magnifier=true)
if time == timestamp("UTC", 2025, 6, 22, 12, 45) and strategy.position_size == 0
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, qty = math.floor(4.608 * strategy.equity / close * 1000) / 1000)
if strategy.position_size > 0 and bar_index - strategy.opentrades.entry_bar_index(0) >= 3
    strategy.close("L", comment="timeout")
